  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the formal resignation of Gibran Rakabuming Raka from the office of Vice President, the Indonesian government has entered a transition process to fill the vacancy. President Prabowo Subianto confirmed that he had been in consultation with the outgoing Vice President for several days prior to the official announcement. Upon accepting the resignation, President Prabowo expressed appreciation for the contributions made during the tenure. Moving forward, the President is scheduled to meet with leaders of the coalition political parties to determine two potential candidates for the position. Additionally, the House of Representatives Commission III has engaged with the President to review the legal and procedural requirements for the upcoming selection. In his final hours at the Vice Presidential Palace, the former official held meetings with staff, volunteers, and political representatives before officially vacating the residence.",
